3 true] [17592186673244 1083 #uuid "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673245 1080 "y=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{6}{6 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 1}}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673245 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673245 1083 #uuid "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673246 1080 "y=\\frac{9 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{3}}{9 \\cdot C - 2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{9}{2}}}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673246 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673246 1083 #uuid "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673247 1068 #edb/ref 17592186673250 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673247 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673247 1071 "Find the general nonzero real solution to the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}- \\frac{y}{\\left(x+3\\right)}=- \\sqrt{\\left(x+3\\right)} \\cdot y^{2}.\n$$\n\nWork on an interval where $\\left(x+3\\right)>0$. Choose constants and intervals on which the displayed expressions are real and finite.\n\n{{selection}}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673247 1072 #uuid "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673247 1074 "This is a Bernoulli equation with\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}p(x)&=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\\\ q(x)&=- \\sqrt{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\\\ n&=2.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivide by $y^{2}$ and set $z=y^{-1}$. The chain rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{y^{2}}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$$\n\nHence the linear equation in standard form is\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}+\\left(\\frac{1}{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\right)z=\\sqrt{\\left(x+3\\right)}.$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$I(x)=e^{\\int \\frac{1}{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x}=\\left(x+3\\right).$$\n\nMultiplying through and using the product rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(\\left(x+3\\right)\\,z\\right)=\\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}.$$\n\nIntegrating with respect to $x$, we obtain\n\n$$\\left(x+3\\right)z=\\frac{2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{5}{2}}}{5}+C.$$\n\nThus\n\n$$z=\\frac{C}{\\left(x+3\\right)} + \\frac{2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}{5}.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{-1}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)}{5 \\cdot C + 2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{5}{2}}}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals." 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673248 1080 "y=\\frac{3}{3 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{\\frac{3 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}{2}} + 2}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673248 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673248 1083 #uuid "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673249 1080 "y=\\frac{1}{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{\\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}{2}} - 1}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673249 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673249 1083 #uuid "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673241 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673246 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673254 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673260 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673271 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1077 "selection" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673250 1078 #e