} - 2.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{\\frac{1}{2}}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} - 2\\right)^{2}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals. The displayed expression for $z$ must be positive because $z=y^{\\frac{1}{2}}>0$." 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673253 1080 "y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{10 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} + \\frac{1}{2}}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673253 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673253 1083 #uuid "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673254 1080 "y=\\frac{7 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{2}}{7 \\cdot C - 6 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{7}{2}}}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673254 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673254 1083 #uuid "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673239 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673251 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673256 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673258 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1075 #edb/ref 17592186673265 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1077 "selection" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1078 #edb/ref 17592186673256 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673255 1079 #uuid "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673256 1080 "y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} - 2\\right)^{2}" 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673256 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538751 17592186045443 true] [17592186673256 1083 #uuid "7920eb08-55a3-563